{"skill":{"slug":"google-ads-api","displayName":"Google Ads"},"version":{"version":"1.2.8","createdAt":1790937386311,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":52357,"sha256":"e4013d2d31e9650c53c32d9b3bebfc332bb69a9e4cb86a0f9257eb322159ea7a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2450,"sha256":"b8434a99f4b80a845986f9895b39baee837a5a05b166047681bee9fe198ba643","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790937952481,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7f3fa2680a10aaef51b4fe3920c18fc85ea986aefe7ee428b2615b144049bfc9","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7f3fa2680a10aaef51b4fe3920c18fc85ea986aefe7ee428b2615b144049bfc9","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790937719633},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":9,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1790937952481},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This Google Ads skill is broad but its sensitive actions are disclosed, scoped to user-approved Maton/Google Ads connections, and guarded by explicit approval instructions.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Requested Bash/Read/Grep/Glob and network access fit a CLI-based Google Ads integration. The skill warns not to inspect credential stores or unrelated secrets and limits raw API-key handling to environments where the CLI cannot be installed.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation is via pinned Maton CLI paths (npm or Homebrew) and there are no executable files shipped in the artifact; raw HTTP and SDK use are documented as alternatives with credential-handling cautions.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill includes shared trigger references for other Maton event sources, including HubSpot, but both SKILL.md and the reference files say these do not widen Google Ads access and should only be used when the user names that source.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"OAuth tokens, functions, triggers, destinations, and event watches can create ongoing access or automation, but these are explicitly disclosed, user-approved, and accompanied by warnings about persistent forwarding, local execution, and deletion/cleanup.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill's main purpose is Google Ads access through Maton OAuth, with read/list defaults and documented write operations for campaigns and related Google Ads resources. Hosted functions, triggers, and destinations are explained as optional automation mechanisms rather than hidden Google Ads capability.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be comfortable that this skill can operate on Google Ads business data and can help create persistent automations if you approve them. Use read-only queries first, confirm every write or connection, avoid third-party trigger destinations unless you explicitly trust the host, and prefer the CLI OAuth flow over raw API keys.","findings":"[SDI-1] expected: Accepted as a packaging/scope note but downgraded as a security concern: the HubSpot trigger file is real, but it is framed as shared Maton platform reference material, not as Google Ads functionality, and the skill repeatedly says other event sources require a user-named connection and approval.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790937952481}}}}}